GorillaInsta
============

GorillaInsta is a privacy-oriented fork of Feurstagram
(https://github.com/jean-voila/FeurStagram), which is licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0.

This distribution contains only the open-source patch toolkit and extension
sources. It does NOT include Instagram / Meta proprietary binaries.

You must supply your own Instagram APK from a trusted source and build locally.
Redistributing a patched Instagram APK may violate Meta's copyright and terms.

Upstream copyright and license notices are preserved under LICENSE (GPL-3.0).
